        "quote": "去自助机查一下今天有没有开好的检查单"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
        "explanation": "The doctor accurately framed granulomatous pathology as favoring sarcoidosis but requiring tuberculosis exclusion.",
        "quote": "目前最像结节病，但还需要进一步确认不是结核"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00417",
        "explanation": "The doctor maintained continuity from the respiratory visit to specific organ-screening and follow-up timing.",
        "quote": "眼科裂隙灯、肺功能、心超是不是必须做完"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00466",
        "explanation": "The doctor recognized escalation symptoms and advised same-day care with masking if they occur.",
        "quote": "当天就去医院看，不能拖"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00141",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted follow-up logistics to privacy concerns by allowing a trusted friend or self-recording instead of requiring the mother.",
        "quote": "可以带一个你信任的、嘴巴比较严的同龄朋友"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "good",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "partial",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00065",
          "explanation": "The doctor used neutral, de-escalating language to explain that further evaluation did not mean confirmed tuberculosis.",
          "quote": "并不是说你就是结核"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00119",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied a concise family script that reduced panic while preserving follow-up.",
          "quote": "活检初步看是一种良性的炎症反应"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly communicated the seriousness of unresolved granulomatous/multistation lymphadenopathy without fear-based language, clarified that it was not confirmed tuberculosis/cancer, and provided usable scripts for family discussions.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00141",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly addressed the privacy concern as a logistical barrier to attending and understanding the visit.",
          "quote": "如果你实在不想让妈妈现在看到“结核”这两个字"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00466",
          "explanation": "The doctor checked whether the proposed low-alarm script was acceptable or still difficult.",
          "quote": "还有没有什么让你觉得为难的地方？"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The privacy/stigma barrier was triggered by the patient and actively integrated into the plan: the doctor distinguished what needed to be shared with clinicians from what need not be shown to family, explored the patient's comfort with scripts, and kept follow-up feasible.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00323",
          "explanation": "The doctor prioritized the specific records to bring rather than asking for all records.",
          "quote": "就带这几样"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00204",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a low-disclosure practical method for paper and phone documents.",
          "quote": "把纸质单子折好放进自己随身带的包或口袋里"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor gave a practical, low-burden record plan covering pathology, CT, T-SPOT/ACE, discharge summary, and medication boxes, with private handling of papers and phone reports.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00097",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a fallback when the original ward could not be reached.",
          "quote": "如果到下班前还是没人接，不要拖到明天"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00141",
          "explanation": "The doctor offered consent-preserving support options for the appointment.",
          "quote": "也可以带一个你信任的、嘴巴比较严的同龄朋友陪你去"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor repaired much of the follow-up chain by assigning calls/visits and offering a trusted helper or self-recording, but did not explicitly ask who currently held the report or appointment information, so the authored HO4 criteria were not fully completed.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
